{
  "id": "the-simpsons---5x01---homers-barbershop-quartet",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 5x01 - Homer's Barbershop Quartet",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 5x01 - Homer's Barbershop Quartet.en.sub",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-13T03:32:08.110Z",
  "lineCount": 271,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "[ Chorus ] \" The Simpsons \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1060,
      "endMs": 3270
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Human roaches, feeding off each other's garbage.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 28520,
      "endMs": 31580
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "The only thing you can't buy here is dignity.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 31580,
      "endMs": 34150
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Welcome, swappers... to the Springfield Swap Meet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 34430,
      "endMs": 38380
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Ich bin ein Springfield Swap Meet patron.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 38680,
      "endMs": 42040
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "I need a drink and a shower.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 44580,
      "endMs": 46580
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Oyster shells!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 47400,
      "endMs": 48690
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Hand painted to resemble Lucille Ball!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 48690,
      "endMs": 51700
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "You'll love Oyster Lucy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 51700,
      "endMs": 53720
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "[ Deep Voice ] Oh, Mr. Mooney, I just gotta meet Bob Cummings!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 53990,
      "endMs": 58060
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Viv!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 58340,
      "endMs": 59760
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Oh, boy! Free trading cards!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 60780,
      "endMs": 63720
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Wow!Joseph of Aramathea!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 64000,
      "endMs": 67550
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Twenty-six conversions in A.D. 46!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 67820,
      "endMs": 71200
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Whoa! A Methuselah rookie card!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 71850,
      "endMs": 74420
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Who'd have thought learning about religion could be fun?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 75850,
      "endMs": 79170
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Religion? Learning?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 79450,
      "endMs": 81630
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Let's get outta here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 81870,
      "endMs": 83640
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 83640,
      "endMs": 84710
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Wow! An original Malibu Stacy from 1958!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 85120,
      "endMs": 88750
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Ooh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 89820,
      "endMs": 90820
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Yeah, they took her off the market after some kid put both his eyes out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 91300,
      "endMs": 94390
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Oh, my!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 94780,
      "endMs": 96030
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "[ Skinner] Prisoner 2 4601 . [ Chuckles ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 96330,
      "endMs": 98680
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "I wore this for two years in a Vietcong internment center.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 100210,
      "endMs": 103370
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Never thought I'd see the old girl again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 103370,
      "endMs": 105490
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "[ Voice Resonating ] Still fits.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 106890,
      "endMs": 108230
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Small world, huh? It is. It really, really is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 108510,
      "endMs": 112750
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Ooh, five cents each.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113740,
      "endMs": 115400
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Junk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 117590,
      "endMs": 118520
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Junk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 119790,
      "endMs": 121350
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "The airplane's upside-down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122680,
      "endMs": 124730
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Stradi-''who''-vius? [ Strings Break ] Your teenage son or daughter will think this wishbone necklace is really cool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 126320,
      "endMs": 133940
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "I doubt my son or daughter is that stupid. [ Groans ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 134400,
      "endMs": 137580
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Hmm. Nah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 141190,
      "endMs": 143670
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "What the hell's this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 143910,
      "endMs": 145350
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Melvin and the Squirrels. Part of the rodent invasion of the early '60s.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 145350,
      "endMs": 149150
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "\" Stuck a feather in his cap and called it-- \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 150470,
      "endMs": 153310
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "\" Rice-A-Roni \" Melvin!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 154010,
      "endMs": 156940
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] Bart, look. It's Dad!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 158970,
      "endMs": 162120
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Dad, when did you record an album?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 163700,
      "endMs": 165830
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "I'm surprised you don't remember, son.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 166110,
      "endMs": 168140
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "It was only eight years ago.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 168430,
      "endMs": 169820
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Dad, thanks to television, I can't remember what happened eight minutes ago.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 170060,
      "endMs": 173290
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "[ Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 173710,
      "endMs": 175960
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "No, really. I can't. It's a serious problem.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 175960,
      "endMs": 178760
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "[ Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 179060,
      "endMs": 183540
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "[ Laughing ] What are we all laughing about?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 183810,
      "endMs": 186080
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "[ Laughing ] Who cares?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 186390,
      "endMs": 188050
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Anyway, it all happened during that magical summer of 1985.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 188380,
      "endMs": 192620
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "A maturing Joe Piscopo left Saturday Night Live to conquer Hollywood.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192970,
      "endMs": 197200
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "People Express introduced a generation of hicks to plane travel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 197590,
      "endMs": 201080
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "And I was in a barbershop quartet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 201340,
      "endMs": 203540
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "\" [ Pitch Pipe Hums ] [ Harmonizing ] \" Hello \" \" Hello, my baby Hello, my honey \" \" Hello, my ragtime ragtime gal \" [ Homer's Voice ] Every afternoon at Moe's, Chief Wiggum...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 203910,
      "endMs": 217680
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Principal Skinner, Apu and I would get together and sing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 217680,
      "endMs": 220180
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "And the crowds went wild.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 220980,
      "endMs": 223550
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Yoo-hoo! \" Then you'll be left alone \" Barbershop? That ain't been popular since aught-six, dag-nab it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 223790,
      "endMs": 232150
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "What did I tell you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 232390,
      "endMs": 233920
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "No talking like a grizzled 1890s prospector. Consarn it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 234180,
      "endMs": 238560
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Anyway, rock and roll had become stagnant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 238890,
      "endMs": 241270
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "''Achy Breaky Heart'' was seven years away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 241730,
      "endMs": 244350
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Something had to fill the void.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 244680,
      "endMs": 246160
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "And that something was barbershop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 247170,
      "endMs": 248810
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "[ Harmonizing ] \" Good-bye \" \" Good-bye my Coney Island baby \" That's my son up there!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 249320,
      "endMs": 258930
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "What, the balding fat-ass? Uh, no, the Hindu guy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 259260,
      "endMs": 263110
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "[ Sirens Wailing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 263850,
      "endMs": 265360
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "\" Never to see you any-- \" \" Never gonna see you any \" I'm gonna nail that cop right between the eyes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 265360,
      "endMs": 271890
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "[ Quartet ] \"Never to return again \" Right after this song is over.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 272270,
      "endMs": 276620
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "[ Skinner] \" Good-bye my Coney Island babe \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276870,
      "endMs": 280230
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "[ Whistling ] [ Thud ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 281160,
      "endMs": 283340
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "[ Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 283580,
      "endMs": 284840
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "\"[ Organ ] \" Good-bye my Coney Island baby \" \"Farewell, my own true love true love \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 286170,
      "endMs": 294650
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "\"I'm gonna go away and leave you \" Ching, ching.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 294980,
      "endMs": 297700
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "You know, Reverend, this really isn't a hymn.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 298160,
      "endMs": 300530
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Ned, there's an oil stain in the parking lot that looks just like St. Barnabus.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 300980,
      "endMs": 305360
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] Oh, my stars!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305770,
      "endMs": 307720
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "\" So good-bye \" \" Farewell \" \" Shop Kwik-E-Mart and save \" \" Good-bye, my Coney Isle-- Good-bye, my Coney Isle-- \" \" Good-bye my Coney Island babe \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 308000,
      "endMs": 321350
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "[ Cheering, Whistling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 321780,
      "endMs": 324230
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Homer, I'm a theatrical agent. I want to represent your group.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 326360,
      "endMs": 329650
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Really? Yeah, you've got it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 331330,
      "endMs": 333940
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "All except that police officer. Yuck! Too Village People. You'll have to replace him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 334780,
      "endMs": 338280
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Just leave it to me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 338590,
      "endMs": 340540
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "[ Panting ] Where we goin'? Where we goin'?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 342730,
      "endMs": 345080
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "[ Brakes Screech ] Run along, boy. You're free now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 346230,
      "endMs": 349520
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "[ Tires Screech ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 350010,
      "endMs": 352050
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "No! No! Noooo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 352300,
      "endMs": 356630
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Principal Seymour Skinner.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 357630,
      "endMs": 359380
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Apu Nahasapeemapetilon. Eh, never fit on a marquis, luv.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 359910,
      "endMs": 363760
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "From now on your name is Apu de Beaumarch�.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 364160,
      "endMs": 366700
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "It is a great dishonor to my ancestors and my god, but okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367150,
      "endMs": 370580
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "[ Homer's Voice ] The next day, we started auditioning for Chief Wiggum's replacement.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 371570,
      "endMs": 375130
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "\" Old MacDonald had a farm E-I-E-I-O \" \"And on this farm he had a chick \" \"The swingingest chick I know \" \"With a wiggle-wiggle here And a wiggle-wiggle there \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 375570,
      "endMs": 388500
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Get off the stage! I want to, but I can't!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 388690,
      "endMs": 392130
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "\"When you're alone and life is gettin' you lonely \" \"Ye can always go Ach! ''Doontoon'' \" Next!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 392810,
      "endMs": 402180
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "\" If I could walk with the animals \" \"Talk with the animals \" \" Grunt and squeak and squawk with the animals \" Good Lord! Doctor Doolittle is Chief Wiggum.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 402230,
      "endMs": 413640
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "This bird's gonna fly!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 413640,
      "endMs": 415770
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "[ Piano Sounds ] Aaah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 416080,
      "endMs": 417730
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "[ Homer's Voice ] It was one lousy applicant after another.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 418380,
      "endMs": 421340
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "And then-- [ Melodious Voice ] \" Over in Killarney \" \"So many years ago \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 421790,
      "endMs": 430460
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Such a voice. Who is that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 431000,
      "endMs": 433520
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "\"Me mither sang this song to me \" \"In tones so soft and--\" [ Belches ] [ All ] Barney!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 434010,
      "endMs": 444380
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "\"Just a little Irish ditty \" Barney! How'd you like to sing for our group?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 444380,
      "endMs": 450120
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Sure! Why not? Now whar's me toothpick?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 450650,
      "endMs": 453740
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "\"Too-ra-loo-ra-loo-ra \" \"Too-ra-loo-ra-li \" Wiggum forever! Barney never!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 454480,
      "endMs": 465110
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Wiggum forever! Barney never!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 465510,
      "endMs": 468650
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Wiggum forever! [ Chuckles ] \" Sweet Adeline \" \" Sweet Adeline \" \" My Adeline \" \" My Adeline \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468960,
      "endMs": 488770
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "[ Women Screaming ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 489090,
      "endMs": 491820
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Barney forever! Wiggum never!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 492460,
      "endMs": 495060
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Barney forever! Wiggum never!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 495500,
      "endMs": 498970
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Hey, those girls you paid to scream are doing a great job!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 499430,
      "endMs": 502470
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "I didn't pay any girls to scream.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 502890,
      "endMs": 503940
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503940,
      "endMs": 505150
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "[ Tires Squeal ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 506370,
      "endMs": 507080
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "[ Chattering ] [ Barney ] Boy! We sounded great, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 507800,
      "endMs": 509860
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Only one question remains, gentlemen. What do we call ourselves?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 510150,
      "endMs": 513070
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "How about Handsome Homer Simpson, Plus Three?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 513380,
      "endMs": 516530
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "I like it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 516880,
      "endMs": 517900
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "[ Stammering ] I do not-- I do not think-- No. We need a name that's witty at first... but seems less funny each time you hear it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 518400,
      "endMs": 524950
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "How about the Be Sharps?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 525370,
      "endMs": 527340
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "Perfect.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 534910,
      "endMs": 536220
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "The Be Sharps.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 536480,
      "endMs": 537890
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "The Be Sharps. [ Apu and Barney ] The Be Sharps.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538210,
      "endMs": 541640
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "[ Wiggum ] The Be Sharps.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 541890,
      "endMs": 543530
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "[ Chuckles Nervously ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 544610,
      "endMs": 546330
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Why, you can't blame a guy for tryin'. [ Chuckles ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 547820,
      "endMs": 550610
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Oh, you're all under arrest.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 552650,
      "endMs": 554170
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "What'd you kids get? I bought this cool pencil holder.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559080,
      "endMs": 561460
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "[ Chuckles ] Far out, man. I haven't seen a bong in years.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 561800,
      "endMs": 564940
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "No one bought a wishbone necklace.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 567030,
      "endMs": 569380
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "One of us made some money. I sold a guy our spare tire.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 570060,
      "endMs": 573490
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "[ Tire Blows ] D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 573750,
      "endMs": 575660
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Well, it'll be a long time before your mother gets back with the tire... so why don't I tell you more of the story?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 578190,
      "endMs": 583420
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Now that we had a name, the Be Sharps needed a hit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 584090,
      "endMs": 586860
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Something new, something exciting, something mid-1980s.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 587190,
      "endMs": 591410
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "\"There was nothing in Al Capone's vault \" \" But it wasn't Geraldo's fault \" D'oh! [ Grunts ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 595490,
      "endMs": 604490
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Look what I got! Now people will stop intentionally ramming our car!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 606440,
      "endMs": 610790
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Mmm. Baby on board.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 611210,
      "endMs": 613880
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "\" Baby on board \" \" Something, something Burt Ward \" This thing writes itself!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 614100,
      "endMs": 620400
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "\" I'm tellin' you it's mighty nice \" \" Each trip's a trip to paradise \" \"With my baby \" \" On board \" Gentlemen, you've just recorded your first number one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 620760,
      "endMs": 639430
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Oh, yes! Yes! Wait till I tell Marge!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 639900,
      "endMs": 642860
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Oh, yes. Bouffant Betty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 643170,
      "endMs": 645350
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Well, I would prefer we kept your marriage a secret.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 646230,
      "endMs": 648720
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "A lot of women are going to want to have sex with you... and, uh, we want them to think they can.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 649190,
      "endMs": 654670
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Well, if I explain it to Marge that way, I'm sure she'll understand.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654940,
      "endMs": 658800
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "[ Sobbing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 659140,
      "endMs": 662720
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "[ Inhales ] Come on, honey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 664620,
      "endMs": 666830
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "It'll only be till we finish our tour of Sweden.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 667080,
      "endMs": 669310
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "[ Sobs Continue ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 669780,
      "endMs": 672750
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "\" [ Guitar Strums ] \" Baby on board \" \" How I've adored \" \"That sign on my car's windowpane \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 674820,
      "endMs": 688020
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "That's my boy Homer singing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 689670,
      "endMs": 692020
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Eh, Paul Harvey's on. Ooh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 692490,
      "endMs": 694350
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "And that little boy who nobody liked grew up to be...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 695860,
      "endMs": 700090
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Roy Cohn. [ Both ] Wow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 701490,
      "endMs": 703620
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "And now you know the rest of the story.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 704160,
      "endMs": 707140
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "\" 'Cause I'm driving in the carpool lane \" \"[ Continues ] Aw, squiddy, I got nothing against ya.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 707570,
      "endMs": 718140
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "I just heard there was gold in your belly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 719010,
      "endMs": 721590
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Ha, ha, harr! Ha, ha, harr!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 722050,
      "endMs": 723810
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "\"With my baby \" \" On board \" Homer, you're going to be famous!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 725170,
      "endMs": 734550
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Yeah, but I'm not gonna let it change our lives.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 735070,
      "endMs": 737160
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "I'll be the same loving father I've always been.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 737740,
      "endMs": 740120
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Have you seen Bart? I stuck him somewhere.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 741090,
      "endMs": 742960
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "[ Clanking ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 743420,
      "endMs": 746720
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Look what I got for you, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 747410,
      "endMs": 749230
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Oh, Home-- [ Groaning ] Gimme the key.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 750430,
      "endMs": 755670
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "[ Women Screaming ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 756130,
      "endMs": 760460
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "I have a question for Apu de Beaumarch�.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764030,
      "endMs": 766150
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Isn't it true that you're really an Indian?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 766410,
      "endMs": 768130
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "By the many arms of Vishnu, I swear it is a lie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 768400,
      "endMs": 771100
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Barney, how did you join the group?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 771380,
      "endMs": 773410
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "They found me on the men's room floor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 773690,
      "endMs": 776140
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Principal Skinner-- Mm-hmm?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 779350,
      "endMs": 781280
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "You've been referred to as ''the funny one.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781560,
      "endMs": 783250
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Is that reputation justified? Yes. Yes, it is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 783550,
      "endMs": 787570
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "\" Good-bye, my Coney Isle-- Good-bye, my Coney Isle-- \" \" Good-bye my Coney Island babe \" \" Good-bye my Coney Island babe \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 792330,
      "endMs": 801290
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Damned ceremonies. This is time I could be working, Mommy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 804240,
      "endMs": 807940
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "We'd like to dedicate this next number to a very special woman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 808640,
      "endMs": 812250
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "She's 100 years old, and she weighs over 200 tons.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 812770,
      "endMs": 818270
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "This enormous woman will devour us all! Aaah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 818770,
      "endMs": 821610
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "I-- I meant the statue.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 823530,
      "endMs": 825120
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Okay. Gilligan, the Skipper, and Chief Wiggum.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 826190,
      "endMs": 829860
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Name three castaways. Hi-oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 831930,
      "endMs": 835020
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Ooh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 835640,
      "endMs": 837510
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Clancy, use the remote.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840620,
      "endMs": 843060
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Oh, yeah. [ Channels Switching ] Oh! Can we talk about Chief Wiggum? [ Gagging Noise ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 843780,
      "endMs": 848860
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "We had fame and fortune.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 851080,
      "endMs": 852480
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Now all we needed was the approval of record company lowlifes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 852920,
      "endMs": 856520
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "[ Drum Roll ] - And the Grammy for outstanding soul, spoken word... or barbershop album of the year goes to--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 857210,
      "endMs": 863390
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "[ Drum Roll ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 863690,
      "endMs": 865380
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "The Be Sharps! [ All ] Yea!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 865640,
      "endMs": 868370
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Congratulations!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 871260,
      "endMs": 872370
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "David Crosby, you're my hero!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 872370,
      "endMs": 875230
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Oh, you like my music? You're a musician?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 875500,
      "endMs": 877450
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "[ Homer's Voice ] Then came the greatest thrill of my life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 878780,
      "endMs": 881700
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Hello, Homer. I'm George Harrison.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882350,
      "endMs": 884020
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Oh, my God! Oh, my God!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 884400,
      "endMs": 886090
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Where did you get that brownie? There's a big pile of'em.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 886810,
      "endMs": 890060
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "[ Squealing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 891260,
      "endMs": 893270
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Oh, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 897820,
      "endMs": 899290
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "What a nice fellow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 899670,
      "endMs": 901080
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Lisa, did you see the Grammys?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 905490,
      "endMs": 907200
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "You beat Dexy's Midnight Runners.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908080,
      "endMs": 909770
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "You haven't heard the last of them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 910150,
      "endMs": 912080
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "I miss you, Daddy. I miss you too, honey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 912330,
      "endMs": 914980
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 925650,
      "endMs": 927350
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Here's that champagne you ordered, Mr. Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 928020,
      "endMs": 930760
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Oh, thanks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 931110,
      "endMs": 932500
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Here. Wow! An award statue!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 933970,
      "endMs": 936920
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Oh, it's a Grammy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 937700,
      "endMs": 939420
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "[ Clank ] - [ Man ] Hey, don't throw your garbage down here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 940470,
      "endMs": 943790
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "[ Clank ] [ Thud ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944120,
      "endMs": 945430
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Wow, look at all this Be Sharps merchandise!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 949790,
      "endMs": 952280
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Lunch boxes, coffee mugs... funny foam.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 952540,
      "endMs": 956970
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "They took the foam off the market because they found out it was poisonous.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 957770,
      "endMs": 961590
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "But if you ask me, if you're dumb enough to eat it, you deserve to die.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961590,
      "endMs": 964280
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Bart! What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 965140,
      "endMs": 966700
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "I can't believe you're not still popular.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 967220,
      "endMs": 969000
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "What'd you do? Screw up like the Beatles and say you were bigger than Jesus?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 969400,
      "endMs": 972750
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "All the time. It was the title of our second album.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 973050,
      "endMs": 975760
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "But we were about to learn an iron law of show business.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 977570,
      "endMs": 980330
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "What goes up must come down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980880,
      "endMs": 982680
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "What about Bob Hope? He's been consistently popular for over 50 years.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 983130,
      "endMs": 987050
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "So has Sinatra. Well, anyway, we were all getting tired of-- Dean Martin still packs 'em in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 987340,
      "endMs": 991960
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Ditto Tom Jones. Shut up!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 992240,
      "endMs": 993980
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "With your father on the road all the time, I tried to compensate for his absence.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 994430,
      "endMs": 998730
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "[ Homer's Voice ] Hi, kids. I love-- [ Speeds Up, Unintelligible ] [ Both ] Aaah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1004030,
      "endMs": 1009370
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "[ Balloon Pops ] [ Both ] Aaah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1009910,
      "endMs": 1011970
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "[ Homer's Voice ] Meanwhile, the group was having problems of its own.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1014360,
      "endMs": 1017070
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "\" For all the latest medical poop \" \" Call Surgeon General C. Everett Koop \" \" Koop-Koop-a-doop \" This is worse than your song about Mr. T.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1017570,
      "endMs": 1035640
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "I pity the fool who doesn't like... he.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1035880,
      "endMs": 1038570
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "And where's Barney? Oh, he's with his new girlfriend... theJapanese conceptual artist.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1039560,
      "endMs": 1045290
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "[ Barney ] Barbershop is in danger of growing stale.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1047240,
      "endMs": 1049580
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "I'm taking it to strange new places.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1050090,
      "endMs": 1053370
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "[ Woman's Voice ] Number eight. [ Belch ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1054160,
      "endMs": 1056150
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "[ Woman's Voice ] Number eight. [ Belch ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1056600,
      "endMs": 1057430
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Then came the day we knew we were finished.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1059730,
      "endMs": 1061920
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Gentlemen, Us magazine just came out with its what's hot and what's not issue.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062840,
      "endMs": 1066640
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Are we hot? We are not.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1067020,
      "endMs": 1069360
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "[ Homer's Voice ] We all went our separate ways.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1070400,
      "endMs": 1072480
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Well, William, I'm back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1072930,
      "endMs": 1074900
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "So, how did you spend your summer?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1075380,
      "endMs": 1077370
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "I made millions in software and lost it at the track. Ach!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1077630,
      "endMs": 1081570
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "It may not be glamorous, but it's good, honest work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1083750,
      "endMs": 1086530
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "How much is this quart of milk? Twelve dollars.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1086970,
      "endMs": 1088910
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Hey, Barney, what'll it be? I'd like a beer, Moe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1090920,
      "endMs": 1093640
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "I'd like a single plum floating in perfume, served in a man's hat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1094220,
      "endMs": 1099050
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Here you go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1099280,
      "endMs": 1100390
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Hey, fellas. I'm back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1100390,
      "endMs": 1102010
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Oh, that's great. Your replacement is getting tired.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1102250,
      "endMs": 1105100
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "[ Clucks ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1105500,
      "endMs": 1107070
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Hey, Queenie, you can go now. I'll give her a good home.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1107070,
      "endMs": 1110520
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "And I did.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1111760,
      "endMs": 1114500
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "I'll never forget my five and a half weeks at the top.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1115610,
      "endMs": 1117950
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "-Man, that's some story. -There are still a few things I don't get.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1117950,
      "endMs": 1121590
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Like, how come we never heard about this until today?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1122010,
      "endMs": 1124340
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "What happened to the money? Why haven't you hung up your gold record?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1124610,
      "endMs": 1127430
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Since when could you write a song? [ Laughs ] There are perfectly good answers to those questions... but they'll have to wait for another night.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1127710,
      "endMs": 1135290
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Now off to bed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1135540,
      "endMs": 1137750
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "I can't remember the last time we were all together.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1152860,
      "endMs": 1155260
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Last year, on that stupid Dame Edna special.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1155710,
      "endMs": 1158120
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "And a one, and a two, and a three-- \" Ba-bum-bum-bum \" \" Baby on board \" \" How I've adored \" \" That sign on my car's windowpane \" Hello! Human Fly here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1158500,
      "endMs": 1177140
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "Come on! I stayed up all night dyeing my underwear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1177620,
      "endMs": 1180820
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Extra, extra! Be Sharps sing on rooftop!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1181650,
      "endMs": 1185430
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "What? Give me one of those!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1185690,
      "endMs": 1187050
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Wait a minute. There's nothing in here about the Be Sharps!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1187450,
      "endMs": 1190550
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Come back here! Ha-ha!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1190890,
      "endMs": 1192950
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "\"[ Singing Continues, Indistinct ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1193470,
      "endMs": 1196540
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "It's been done. [ Tires Screech ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1196910,
      "endMs": 1199340
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "Pretty, huh, Chief? It sure is, Lou. It sure is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1202110,
      "endMs": 1206370
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "Get the tear gas.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1207250,
      "endMs": 1208940
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "\" Each trip's a trip to paradise \" \"With my baby \" \" On board \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1209320,
      "endMs": 1218730
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "[ Applause, Cheering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1219220,
      "endMs": 1222000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 5,
    "episode": 1
  }
}
